  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55fc6c54cc4ed175815930db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和她一起追求“赛马娘可能性的尽头”\n的日子又再次开始了。第一个目标\n就是即将举办的GⅠ竞赛“大阪杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36676e39c2f08256ad33405637db182c9658024151d82e6b96cf16b6a9465cdd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82d008ba737281221436a3e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Report“告白”",
      "source_fingerprint": "600f2d24192d7056b09fe14f05143b69154ac77dc51aeac20a01269080d8301e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1beff338d2c6f5d209b0ca6b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子为了“有马纪念”\n在寻找自己不足的“某项事物”，\n最终她认为那就是“劲敌”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc9d8d70c24c89ad2d9d1a96055a6777d6546716687084e4c5d6db9e41ac94ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a7df4b35c9521ad8bc3e94f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在某天，爱丽速子透过\n与曼城茶座并跑练习，\n萌生了绝对不能输给她的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f5c3a74893958e040abd728ef203f1925a43b34599b427dca4773d8121c00cb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47be24c0c59eeb8688e95057",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过思考之后，爱丽速子发现\n曼城茶座对自己而言是特别的存在……\n也就是所谓的“劲敌”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8394a375a5892cfc87df8f590ab60bb18eed15a7781504ead64b4714195ee32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0be47fbb65d4c4fb24b86b24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来，爱丽速子在访谈上表示\n她很期待在“有马纪念”上\n和“劲敌”一起比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a652a47f662680ccbf45c39063d1a008a70e402707e724bb641c0d5118dfc68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e8f375a03f287dfbb16b0bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Report“最后的要素”",
      "source_fingerprint": "af383ad601f1ceb53877047fc16f66c358cde38ea735aa460c8f3c4f6a8e9841",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:333fd3d2db53b6094e3fa1f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于一般的赛马娘来说，\n夏季集训是用来提升实力的。不过──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1df6a1393a81b51b7fbff48f3c3484dc2e5c2c2f76215e5db2aff7857bafd30",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5335460323a0856ae6b6956",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子和平常一样，\n因为有许多的实验只能在这段时间进行\n而露出开心的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23f40fd5dc21ce0a418aa5797dd26848309ddc774322a687a24881c7f47fbe3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c1c6947e249ed49f310739d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，与爱丽速子一起度过的\n波涛汹涌的夏季集训开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2127f72a7f5d4e00e342f00deb65d71ddda8fc25002138247d151ec669e49cc0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6914e7ec6c15a46e8361bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第2年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225375376c5fdf8404800f01bfae8c6ed9a9204cddd553a5978ed5b2c0cbe9a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8c3ce26680e788d3dbe7740",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今年的“夏季集训”时期又到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4358a72d4cf11a1c105fdc8a076d460c61bbb37abe0f4d71ee31f30eb76e045a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3603f1e3ae2a36de5c2f6382",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了在仅剩的时间内和爱丽速子一起赢得\n“天皇赏（秋）”和“有马纪念”这两场\n重要比赛，激烈的夏季集训就要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a99c2b313ce04f1bad5a79a6d8a1145a3b5744d3bfcf0fe72781d265269a6e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a4f5671715ebba3e8f39531",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:192d4fd499df310a9a97c655",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是值得纪念的出道战当天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba000653278698f9853ca5e165c29b2773c377d0eeacfef04cd22cda37a7b71e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0058f36ed312ce6a960132d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……即便如此，爱丽速子却在担心\n平常喝的红茶泡完了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e710452e886f676958f944a6e156530c32eedc0ee1ef4cb6134597ce8d911722",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bc44803e1f56046dcd6d202",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她带着对比赛\n毫不紧张的轻松态度……\n走向了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2075032f39e1c0f822e5be7d60dcf32e81631aa4ed4069588f658c2f80328d4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eb7f3f6365dc6f8718fc7dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06c7842b507406f10a325223",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“弥生赏”当天。爱丽速子一如往常地\n思考着研究的事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77e0f84cc626b002285ce7ce6fe2e765c6935c958a7d55dc447813c4517536d9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1f30e7292614098b6fc8c23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员看到她这个样子，\n开始担心她是否肯好好跑完全程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfb3ba55a45baff1e0f48bde9253eb018f84ad2a848aee82a9e08bf81de25088",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:195b6cde518f67a6fc7de61c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她说不会在通往\n“皋月赏”的重要比赛上掉以轻心，\n随后离开了休息室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26d28848cd4f532a90149a9ca30caa2ae71434c0f92ef3611a195050b822385a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a562751b5fd84c3dcfc86e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向弥生赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6227c079367311704f21ad9b5870f8cac34dd0b8f1085a56cb7c9e37c65109f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a55bd31fb628fb8660100dd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“皋月赏”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4f538f89d5afefe489325f0bfd0466e2851c53a43a3d392ae8ab92c1a602f6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6485ad114397cbad38e32604",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子宣称这场比赛所取得的数据\n将会成为今后重要的指标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6f3320bd791c68bd4b215ac98368a702ac9c7f53f66a6c479159707069fc7b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9efaccc90037b7eead93b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为此而准备万全的她，\n前往挑战三冠路线的第一个比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f92d815c646058c47a6b96c8596e4b9a72c009a1ba7fdf89b3d38e705c337258",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebc8790124ca0a5202e54968",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向皋月赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ff224a61598a6c666007568d7268968b6f324292cc2eee89e3b5acc428c30a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52049781be1eb15fedc9332a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“日本德比”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b568ec9720d99d1f17d6f1f49924c5808da2a6e76e6899472755b960baf98f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82d9498c797995033bdfd96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员十分在意爱丽速子\n的跑法有什么改变。\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a9ccd5f29dd4487a35c03162ec61b8457fc09936675b5ab4ffbe3e587cec22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:791b85ccdc8623c22e14674c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表示只需在意今天的结果，\n并在没有任何说明的情况下\n离开了休息室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5253a520bee997ef66156acc7e6e293c8fa83d10a3ceb266c90e8ac12e92d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
