    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6696633f6a4618b9c58433a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“NHK英里C”即将开始前，\n爱丽速子依然打算在这里\n好好收集其他赛马娘的数据。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb44a3b3b0f98416d4cd236182312a21b2df092a3d6183327d6b552282afdd8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b027dcc17bbb440736d04ad7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员十分在意爱丽速子\n的跑法有什么改变。\n但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "44a9ccd5f29dd4487a35c03162ec61b8457fc09936675b5ab4ffbe3e587cec22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9267685ec7ed041b165af904",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表示只需在意今天的结果，\n并在没有任何说明的情况下\n离开了休息室。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5253a520bee997ef66156acc7e6e293c8fa83d10a3ceb266c90e8ac12e92d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:300955e64df3a311a4354081",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向NHK英里C",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d550393dc3881c28bad441a19fab87728aada7325deb0b15f169fa58832519b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21bbaee9228e7a1ad89e54ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于爱丽速子辞退“月桂杯”，\n世人对她的负面想法开始发酵，\n这种情绪也延烧至“菊花赏”的会场上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b257ad3171ee6fb0a4fb689f22e55997138839d81785cdb631422f2db92371e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff89f4b1226236bada496e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然变成身处客场的状况，\n但爱丽速子仍然以我行我素的态度\n前往比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e150caa65760be8265bd6aa857d81de6ab2fdb3515bef1257891a3cf43410f16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57edfc9b88d2f9cb30487bac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee5ce7f40f8657257277230",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“大阪杯”举办当天。\n就算第一场目标比赛迫在眉睫，\n爱丽速子依然保持着放松的状态。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f5455e1bdf43f61d241189753cfa8ed27d5cfb6a44bcaa62f28c42448508cde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efd275dc266a56aa8648b34a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她宣布在抵达“极限前方”之前，\n会送给训练员几场胜利\n当作礼物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e2d99932ee7c433ffd110cd66974c9249106874a81d93162cc830ae15e7dba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfcb1a1ceceb787e7713c543",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着爱丽速子便带着淡淡的微笑\n走向了赛场。\n自此……她的传说也揭开了序幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "449e64e09643cabacb65554ff29a46b4a3292bc722635fd7808299cdf89a01fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29a14bcca66de197920fe0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向大阪杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "4423575424741415861c85b2043870db30adb78bc366fd97792335ee5949271c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963ad10ae7bda0cee41128b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“宝冢纪念”的会场上，\n有许多“大阪杯”时\n迷上爱丽速子的粉丝前来观赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eab74391fa97465a3eb0f4ceb023a91cd7d5229e932a7addcb286e684aea57b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:303e4c9129582a9dc54587da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子在粉丝的声援下，\n迈向了GⅠ竞赛的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a480b3154c90c57162e160658abf070ebf58ffb931b3e7b6dd427bc2f5819f3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:195f061a2a7b7a5c069e7322",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向宝冢纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "4743315d92bef0a1d3815aad5f8b1374f193f12e0416639bccc69a7a0dc88f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ba257e5d7a73730e10ffdd5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "和“大阪杯”时截然不同，\n她在“天皇赏（秋）”的表现备受粉丝期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39d9d34e0a9a5024171713b9eea933d15a1808aa6baf8f2424e50643c5cb76f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de01eae7947e3683e69a4124",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在丝毫不紧张的状态下，\n爱丽速子走向了这场\n决定中距离王者的战斗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "67fc8d8890b86a4270eb86271b58ca3b05776b6e7de6f7e863844549042cf40f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71edc26407f2efc13f8fce91",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向天皇赏（秋）",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd583fd839f6680a57f75e09880ff12f48e50ac7beeab6d01036df8eff7ff5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ccb061495912edb863466eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于来到了“有马纪念”当天。\n爱丽速子与曼城茶座的对决\n受到了世人的瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf25da9717a2e3c81a39d47e0807e3155ce36c8bd37d76f57df26723248504be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86a21cece73fbc7ac26f9fd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "培育至今的“研究的成果”、\n“粉丝们的声援”……\n以及“劲敌的存在”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7a2227345b3be38cbdf1134ef882b4785a0cc9cba92cc2d904f7fd80e050b5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9029f75d89407a9062b83556",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "抵达“可能性的尽头”的所需材料\n全部都凑齐了……\n爱丽速子将前往挑战“有马纪念”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03f42110148c796b91fe49298a2d717dca844406a4a078d213fce270bc908e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f92784a2160e2e9716e65de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73ea1a85f2c6613dd0ce0ba2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比完“出道战”后，\n爱丽速子备受瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c253e91e568c65e67986d7217770210eaf941d008578cb65114a2fe6b4ccf839",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a5877500e93980cebc210a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她并没有沉浸在出道战的余韵中，\n为了继续进行研究，\n她潇洒地离开了会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "213a03b9871263273110c6148baf01c69864ec79e1f06591c0651d71c5ebfab0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:580a62c233b6d9c300a481da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・千般思绪之外",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e3127f9f355112bf0604cef81446065ee3483e52b7415b97a58844fc1b6b89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1261009d1b38cad8558dab07",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子在跑完“弥生赏”的同时\n顺便收集了各种数据。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa698abb15d08d6acbbdf0dadc0ae2fae4e8e7ce80af831f0460c3ba5d3a76be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:910311cbd0937ff269ee87ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她从比赛结果得到启发，\n表示需要对“皋月赏”做好万全准备后，\n便独自回家了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c20699962f2b692bb25edd0ac4f986be60e7988b46a016c6744550535a1b4935",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a8aa414072332bd12202aae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子看似一直在思考。\n但是她并没有告诉训练员……\n自己到底在思考什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2bc0faf6bb33d682437d7c15e961b21d49731c22d50c6c7b5b8bf32fe9a91bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1032/storytimeline_501032420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0763866ec70edada1483a45",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "弥生赏结束后・时间就是金钱",
